{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1000_p", "source_sha256": "292056324b768a07fd39144b7d9b34d0c98db6e0bab502ce7bfb18b71a378331", "ja": "（次の定期公演のセンターだけど……。\nそろそろ、いいタイミングかもしれないな）", "zh": "（关于下次定期公演的Center……\n时机应该差不多成熟了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "8cd6b4f1572d14459f87c1b306166d72bfa0329645bcb749d84bff404d614d27", "ja": "スライダーキック！　ホームランパンチ！\nシュッシュッ……スワッ！", "zh": "滑球踢！全垒打拳！\n咻咻……唰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b7435a53ec7444f57ad785aa1843c52e3bc882fd0eae59cd1eb7ee129333ee64", "ja": "？　あの声は……。", "zh": "这声音是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1003_043nor", "source_sha256": "261bab6c4db0fe3ed43037ea494373261c8ad65553415b58f15cecf30acfef61", "ja": "うんうん、いい感じだよ！　昴は体重が軽いから……\nもっと、スピードつけたほうがいいかも？", "zh": "嗯嗯，感觉很不错！因为昴的体重很轻……\n应该可以再快一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "ad1fe5c753860a66fa46b3e1604362dac91ae1e6b86f0707a5a87b2f55224196", "ja": "おお～。新しいスポーツの誕生ですね～？\nこれは歴史的瞬間かもしれません～。", "zh": "喔喔～新型运动诞生了呢～\n这说不定是见证历史的瞬间喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "5ce256aaa8af60f6e5b265febadd7917b10e4ca59caeaa7483c07e9c9d68b320", "ja": "えへへ～、そっか？\nじゃあ次は……ゲッツーチョップだー！", "zh": "嘿嘿～是吗？\n那接下来……是双杀手刀──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b22f2d6f5298516168db9ac629067c7ca7f7f69efe2d602d831cef8b850c9580", "ja": "おはよう、みんな！\n……昴、何をしてるんだ……？", "zh": "大家早啊！\n……昴，你在做什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "97514663f8ecd2bed1a2bed3c9406bfa2da0e4c6392f1de59022fea4e8a964d5", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nいまオレたち、野球拳の技を考えてたとこなんだ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n我们正在发明野球拳的招式。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "49a3d20efbc1c86ab605b09d9bf18855ed731d6541901a0a016e236a452a6802", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、一緒にやりませんか？\nなかなか楽しいですよ～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，要不要一起想？\n还满有趣的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f48fb14d0834ceeca323f0df39ea354fe58f4ff0ad2a53cd3eb801a75c741f2d", "ja": "え……野球拳？", "zh": "咦……野球拳？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "615750fcc577fbfe55d3fd19d1d8c0a38051e362f1b46c259bea94d199b23829", "ja": "あ、やっぱダメだった？\nアイドルだし、格闘技は危ないもんね。", "zh": "啊，果然不行吗？\n毕竟我们是偶像，练格斗技很危险嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3ca45e1ea1e13fa8a5a1d996d57eaad7559ff536a6d52d139a5141d47bc4431f", "ja": "格闘技……？　なんだかわからないけど、\nとにかく野球拳は危ないから、やめておこうな。", "zh": "格斗技……？我不太懂你们在说什么，\n总之野球拳很危险，不可以随便玩喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "3ac5833e3cdc3d7f955615613a985e95e8892e2b8b39873204e9d05b8d81480b", "ja": "はーい。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "3ac5833e3cdc3d7f955615613a985e95e8892e2b8b39873204e9d05b8d81480b", "ja": "はーい。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1014_p", "source_sha256": "5efd146972c4ed8749a5ab4eb2b71b467269f6b15e7f27b2feac71cc5ce2f0b0", "ja": "ところで、昴。\n次の公演で、センターをやってみないか？", "zh": "话说回来，昴，\n你有没有意愿担任下次公演的Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "09e2a69dba46d987c7da32d704dad3b0143394c8bb390ce145d4034ec65007ad", "ja": "センター……って、お、オレが！？\n{$P$}、いいの！？", "zh": "你说Center……我、我当吗！？\n{$P$}，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1016_p", "source_sha256": "96e3b615e2cae801c6094616046d14fdc79236f74d53815b57628d2c017272ca", "ja": "もちろん！　あとは昴が、\nやりたいと言ってくれるかどうかなんだけど……。", "zh": "当然！\n现在只差你本人的意愿而已了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "10ef08c28162fdcba157f2e74db85ec9021f5d632f819bb3e761caee45c7301a", "ja": "もちろんやるよ！　オレ、やりたいっ！\nうわあ……ついにセンターかぁ……！", "zh": "我当然愿意！我想当！\n哇……终于要当Center了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1018_043nor", "source_sha256": "5320678f11d6df80ad2ca21c9e05deee0ad4de9fdfc3bacab129d2ada2ad62ae", "ja": "やったね、昴！\nそっか、次の公演は昴がセンターか～。", "zh": "太好了呢，昴！\n这样啊，下次公演的Center是昴啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "97f57b1584a3670fac99e4ae90647240958f7f9bf88942ee90bcd9dedd5aecff", "ja": "昴ちゃん、おめでとうございます～。\nきっと、元気いっぱいな公演になりますね～。", "zh": "小昴，恭喜你～\n想必这场公演一定会充满活力～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "56d6626c5e8d6a8d00b114b200c26bf1562d285a6d8e0af81800c36730fba856", "ja": "だよね……よしっ、アタシも一肌脱ぐか！\n昴、どんな公演にしたいの？", "zh": "就是说呀……好，我也来帮忙！\n昴，你想打造什么样的公演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "4805f7562f4a9a8c2a80b62f17b0bdb2650016ec7008e64b1d81c2c9cbb538c1", "ja": "あ、その事なんだけどさ。\nオレ、ずっと考えてたコトがあって……。", "zh": "啊，关于这个问题，\n我一直有个想法……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "04448cdd5dd6f63a3d7a591d4608008f2805e960629d84dbab4d68097a0345a0", "ja": "え！？\nもしかして、野球拳ってそれだったとか！？", "zh": "咦！？\n该不会就是野球拳！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "7f2f6442c797a7193dad6c0c9f90c5bda68330d66a02c485cf712458cf8cdd6e", "ja": "いや、全然そうじゃなくて！　あのさ……。\nうう、これ言うのやっぱハズいな……。", "zh": "不，完全不是啦！那个……\n呜呜，要说出口果然还是很害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "cb97003559e670217ad70dc7038da6fe8f732c5f8f12e7bc0fee0e32c7c24841", "ja": "昴ちゃん、やりたいことがあるなら、\n言ってみたほうがいいですよ～。", "zh": "小昴，如果有什么想法，\n还是说出来比较好喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1025_p", "source_sha256": "6db76bf8962a9252cc4ce23bdeb1a593ec4366b08b8dc358972c8d7715e4336a", "ja": "そうだぞ、昴。実現できるかどうかは別として、\nプロデューサーとして希望は聞いておきたいな。", "zh": "没错，昴。先不论能否真的实现，\n身为制作人，我想先听听你的期望。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2438a4411f1512d4d3d0edf0938fbe8b2323674c95aa8724ecffa0ff85854922", "ja": "何か実現が難しそうな事なのか？　あ、のり子の\nプロレス会場みたいに、スタジアムでとかはまだ……。", "zh": "是什么实行上有困难的要求吗？啊，就像法子办在\n职业摔角会场一样，你想办在体育场之类的也可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "a5a909301016f4b256227700fb0823fc1c916534142dde1ace7077404ca51f0d", "ja": "いや、そんなんじゃなくて！\nえっと、オレ、その……うー……。", "zh": "不，不是那样啦！\n呃，我……那个……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "9698bb2d631c8afbdea9f6cc20292a6440b7323f32614e511d2b4bec6945342e", "ja": "昴？", "zh": "昴？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1029_047sub", "source_sha256": "54b95d2966cd15302d0002c3bca25d6ef6d8f12b5c654a2f4c0ec61f54e87773", "ja": "お、オレ……女の子っぽいっていうか……\nすっげーアイドルっぽい、かわいい公演にしたいっ！！", "zh": "我、我啊……想打造出超有少女感……\n超有偶像感的可爱公演！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1030_047sub", "source_sha256": "f788be27b0d7efb07298f50ff4869933f0d40cbb1a6b569e7a8cc202f7234cae", "ja": "よ、よしっ！　言ったぞ！", "zh": "很、很好！我讲出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1031_043nor", "source_sha256": "3a9e7b8c989747cc766c7d6ccb6dc33207fae1fb805387f5f74ea3bad849ac78", "ja": "昴……！", "zh": "昴……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1032_p", "source_sha256": "0438fdbcfffb9815e7ad9e78b90e4183297325bcd647b83d188d374a8e4c6dcc", "ja": "アイドルっぽくて可愛い公演か。\nいいじゃないか！", "zh": "有偶像风格的可爱公演吗？\n感觉很不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "f31375faa072aecf85666e28a312a24dac1231eaf1c3fa93f4c81ab4f0fbabfd", "ja": "とっても素敵だと思います～。\nけど、どんな感じにしたら良いでしょう～？", "zh": "我觉得非常棒～\n但要营造成什么样的感觉呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1034_043nor", "source_sha256": "04081e4f7e17c24c4cc37dcb9a61826f3c75d5389c4290a951113ca678d1835b", "ja": "アイドルっぽい公演か……アタシも得意じゃないけど、\nとにかく協力するよ！　みんなで考えよう！", "zh": "偶像风格的公演啊……这类的我也不太擅长，\n但一定会帮忙的！大家一起想点子吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "0620537c809b75f75479315eed980e57a6b0b6429cbd17e11b011fa8d4404c28", "ja": "三人寄れば文殊の知恵、と言いますし～。\n{$P$}さんを入れたら4人ですな～。", "zh": "俗话说三个臭皮匠，胜过一个诸葛亮嘛～\n再加上{$P$}先生就变成四个了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1036_047sub", "source_sha256": "496c6d3fe9d529db77c5c5ed163f0017b65453e4c55293e65ad9c179e310461c", "ja": "えへへっ……ふたりとも、ありがとな！\nオレ、がんばるよ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你们！\n我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_038_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_038_1037_p", "source_sha256": "3f49be346b1a135b4ab3ae6772832395aa77efe060609044010878c01265dc9e", "ja": "（昴は照れながらも、自分の気持ちを正直に話した……\nその勇気に応えられるよう、精一杯サポートするぞ！）", "zh": "（昴尽管害羞，还是坦率说出自己的想法……\n我一定要尽全力支援她，来回应她的勇气！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
